    "title": "Boil order issued in parts of Alma due to water main leak - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 hours ago ALMA, Arkansas — A precautionary boil order has been issued for parts of Alma due to a water main leak on Dean Springs Road. The Highway 71 Water District said in a release on May 27 that the order was issued for customers along Dean Springs Road from Highway 71 to Firehouse Road. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
